From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DREAM <dream@invalid>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:35:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] HE-AAC v2 960: PS encoder and downmix QMF synthesis with 30
 slots

The PS encoder (hybrid analysis/synthesis, parameter estimation over two half frames,
downmix with the 6-slot hybrid delay) and the downmix QMF synthesis hard-coded 32 QMF
slots; at 960 the analysis was zero-padded to 32 slots and the synthesis wrote 1024 core
samples per 960-sample frame, so the AAC core coded garbage (core SNR 0.1 dB). They now
run over the frame's slot count (30 for 960; buffer strides keep the 32-slot layout).
